  "title": "The Vertiv view: High-voltage DC will power AI expansion",
  "summary": "Traditional AC power distribution is reaching its physical and practical limits when it comes to the extreme density of modern AI compute. As rack densities push toward and beyond the megawatt threshold, the physical limitations of massive copper conductors, their size, bend radius, and connector requirements, become untenable.",
